# The durable-context pack, kept on the local drive only at the user's direction.
# WARNING for a fresh clone: audit.py, run_all.py, live_report.py,
# testing/audit_nothing_lost.py, testing/bump_spend_docs.py, tools/mkresults.py and
# tools/mkview.py all READ files under CONTEXT/, and CLAUDE.md instructs reading it
# first. Without this folder those checks cannot run. The folder is intact locally.
CONTEXT/*
# HANDOFF.md is the ONLY file under CONTEXT/ a clone still needs: the spend checks read it.
# READING-THE-AGENT.md was negated here too until 2026-09-01, because audit.py scanned it
# for retracted phrases. It is unpublished now at the user's direction and that scan entry
# was removed in the same change, so the negation goes with it. A negation left behind
# would have silently kept the file tracked: git applies the LAST matching pattern.
!CONTEXT/HANDOFF.md

# Kept on the local drive only at the user's direction. WARNING for a fresh clone:

